{"ver": "0.1", "info": {"id": "3st3zX", "date": "1569311772", "viewed": 92, "name": "BlinkStar", "username": "mizu9972", "description": "practice", "likes": 2, "published": 1, "flags": 0, "usePreview": 0, "tags": ["begginer"], "hasliked": 0, "parentid": "", "parentname": ""}, "renderpass": [{"inputs": [], "outputs": [{"id": "4dfGRr", "channel": 0}], "code": "const float PI = 3.141592;\n\nconst float BLINK_SPEED  = 8.0;  //\u70b9\u6ec5\u901f\u5ea6\nconst float BLINK_RADIUS = 0.001; //\u70b9\u6ec5\u534a\u5f84\u500d\u7387\n\nvec2 Star1;\n\nvoid SetStar(){\n    Star1.x = 320.0;\n    Star1.y = 180.0;\n}\n\nvoid mainImage( out vec4 fragColor, in vec2 fragCoord )\n{\n    SetStar();//\u521d\u671f\u5316\n    \n    // Normalized pixel coordinates (from 0 to 1)\n    vec2 uv = fragCoord/iResolution.xy;\n\n    // Time varying pixel color\n    vec3 backcol = vec3(0,0,0); //\u80cc\u666f\u8272\n    vec3 col \t = vec3(1,1,1); //\u70b9\u6ec5\u8272\n\n    float Length = distance(Star1.xy / iResolution.xy,uv.xy);//\u70b9\u6ec5\u4e2d\u5fc3\u304b\u3089\u306e\u8ddd\u96e2\u8a08\u7b97\n    \n    //\u8272\u8a08\u7b97\n    col = (1.0 / Length * col) * BLINK_RADIUS * ((sin(mod(iTime * BLINK_SPEED,PI)) + 1.0) / 2.0);\n    \n    // Output to screen\n    fragColor = vec4(backcol + col,1.0);\n}", "name": "Image", "description": "", "type": "image"}]}